          <y:NodeLabel alignment="center" autoSizePolicy="content" fontFamily="Dialog" fontSize="10" fontStyle="plain" hasBackgroundColor="false" hasLineColor="false" modelName="internal" modelPosition="c" textColor="#5D4037" visible="true">THE E. OBSERVATION CHAIN
0: Kael'thorne's letters + spellbook threat (table)
1–3: Veska — loop, serif, descender
4: registry — “Hold open until the second autumn…”
5: Sereth — “not from this side of the great desert”
