          <y:NodeLabel alignment="center" autoSizePolicy="content" fontFamily="Dialog" fontSize="10" fontStyle="plain" hasBackgroundColor="false" hasLineColor="false" modelName="internal" modelPosition="c" textColor="#5D4037" visible="true">“SETTLED” = recovered cargo.
Haskur's route file: “Recoverable
but unreliable.” The villain of the
wilderness is freight.</y:NodeLabel>
          <y:Shape type="rectangle"/>
        </y:ShapeNode>
      </data>
    </node>
    <node id="c_table">
      <data key="d6">
        <y:ShapeNode>
          <y:Geometry height="108" width="280" x="20" y="1120"/>
          <y:Fill color="#FFF9C4" transparent="false"/>
          <y:BorderStyle color="#C0A040" type="dashed" width="1.5"/>
          <y:NodeLabel alignment="center" autoSizePolicy="content" fontFamily="Dialog" fontSize="10" fontStyle="plain" hasBackgroundColor="false" hasLineColor="false" modelName="internal" modelPosition="c" textColor="#5D4037" visible="true">TABLE CANON
Kael'thorne's cottage letters = E. obs. zero.
Thimblecut poisoned mid-name (assign the
hand — watcher apparatus recommended).
The wax fingerprint: match a courier
much later, or no one. Never E.</y:NodeLabel>
          <y:Shape type="rectangle"/>
        </y:ShapeNode>
      </data>
    </node>
    <node id="c_trina">
      <data key="d6">
        <y:ShapeNode>
          <y:Geometry height="100" width="250" x="1330" y="1120"/>
          <y:Fill color="#FFF9C4" transparent="false"/>
