          <y:NodeLabel alignment="center" autoSizePolicy="content" fontFamily="Dialog" fontSize="10" fontStyle="plain" hasBackgroundColor="false" hasLineColor="false" modelName="internal" modelPosition="c" textColor="#5D4037" visible="true">GM ONLY: Trina's pact is with Tasha
(“The Quiet Patroness”). Surfaces very
late, if ever. Her Veska-opinion copy
went to “my old correspondent
in the wood” = Aldea.</y:NodeLabel>
          <y:Shape type="rectangle"/>
        </y:ShapeNode>
      </data>
    </node>
    <node id="c_herring">
      <data key="d6">
        <y:ShapeNode>
          <y:Geometry height="96" width="240" x="1520" y="850"/>
          <y:Fill color="#FFF9C4" transparent="false"/>
          <y:BorderStyle color="#C0A040" type="dashed" width="1.5"/>
          <y:NodeLabel alignment="center" autoSizePolicy="content" fontFamily="Dialog" fontSize="10" fontStyle="plain" hasBackgroundColor="false" hasLineColor="false" modelName="internal" modelPosition="c" textColor="#5D4037" visible="true">THE HONEST RED HERRING
The “R.” roadhouse = Rosalin.
Five days + 2 clock segments buy
humanity, not intel. The cedar box
pays off in Phase 6.</y:NodeLabel>
          <y:Shape type="rectangle"/>
        </y:ShapeNode>
      </data>
    </node>
    <node id="legend">
      <data key="d6">
        <y:ShapeNode>
          <y:Geometry height="150" width="260" x="1690" y="1000"/>
          <y:Fill color="#FFFFFF" transparent="false"/>
          <y:BorderStyle color="#555555" type="line" width="1.5"/>
          <y:NodeLabel alignment="center" autoSizePolicy="content" fontFamily="Dialog" fontSize="10" fontStyle="plain" hasBackgroundColor="false" hasLineColor="false" modelName="internal" modelPosition="c" textColor="#000000" visible="true">EDGE LEGEND
dark red — command / pay
purple dashed — E.'s correspondence
orange — leverage / coercion
crimson — violence / sabotage
slate dashed — unwitting / reporting
brown dotted — family tie
green — the investigation
violet — the under-road</y:NodeLabel>
          <y:Shape type="rectangle"/>
        </y:ShapeNode>
      </data>
    </node>
